ipkin</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Khutoreskaya</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Tchourzyna</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Soller</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Friedmann</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>A whole genome scan for quantitative trait loci affecting milk protein percentage in Israeli-Holstein cattle, by means of selective milk DNA pooling in a daughter design, using an adjusted false discovery rate criterion</article-title><source>Genetics</source><year>2001</year><volume>157</volume><fpage>1683</fpage><lpage>1698</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11290723</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B21"><label>21</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group><name><surname>Rodriguez-Zas</surname><given-names>SL</given-names></name><name><surname>Southey</surname><given-names>BR</given-names></name><name><surname>Heyen</surname><given-names>DW</given-names></name><name><surname>Lewin</surname><given-names>HA</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Interval and composite interval mapping of somatic cell score, yield, and components of milk in dairy cattle</article-title><source>J Dairy Sci</source><year>2002</year><volume>85</volume><fpage>3081</fpage><lpage>91</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12487475</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B22"><label>22</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group><name><surname>Ron</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Heyen</surname><given-names>DW</given-names></name><name><surname>Weller</surname><given-names>JI</given-names></name></person-group><etal/><article-title>Detection and analysis of a locus affecting milk concentration in a US and Israeli dairy cattle population</article-title><source>Proc 6<sup>th</sup> World Congr. Genet. Appl. Livest. Prod</source><year>1998</year><volume>26</volume><fpage>422</fpage><lpage>425</lpag